Z||000000||Shaft||10-27-2001||06:25 PM||||I just drove the new Altima today and let me tell you....driving that car is the must fun I've had in a while. It brought an instant smile to everyones face that drove it, and it feels like the fastest thing on the road. Heck, with a 0-60 time in 6.2 sec it nearly is. fastest car in its class, and for about the same price as a Camry or Accord.<P>Also, the salesman said some interesting things. He said that when the Maxima gets redesigned next year it will be bigger (of course) and will have a v8 engine option! He also said that Nissan will be cmming out with a full size truck that will rival the Silverado. but then he said it had two sunroofs and some other stuff so I'm guessin it's just a big SUV. <P>This along with the new Z and the Sentra SER comming back will put Nissan back at the top of my list.||||reg||1
