Z||000005||turbo86se||10-28-2001||12:05 AM||||I've had a '95 Altima, and I now have a '00 Altima GLE. I love it. I haven't really decided if I like the looks of the new Altima, but I'd sure love to have the V6 engine in my '00. That would be the shi! Personally, I love the looks of my '00 the best, looks aggressive. <BR>Not too long ago I got a package in the mail from Nissan with the prescription bottle labeled "the cure for the common automobile" or something like that. I got a few brochures, and a free watch if I test drive one. Yesterday I got a letter from Nissan apologizing for theme of the package. When my lease is up on the '00, will I lease one? I hope the dealer keeps me away from the V6 Altima or the S/C Exterra!<BR>Yeah, like that'll happen!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
