Z||000007||Raydar||10-28-2001||07:34 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Screwie:<BR><B>Put some round headlights on that Z and you got yourself a beetle...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_brow.gif"> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'm glad I'm not the only person who isn't too impressed by the "Z". <BR>A few years ago, there was a retro-looking concept Z. I liked it a whole lot better.<P>The new Altima looks pretty impressive. Saw it in Road & Track. <P><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Some mornings, it just isn't worth chewing through the restraints.</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000008||Fformula88||10-29-2001||10:45 AM||||I am all for any company building new sports cars, and I am also reserving judgement on the "Z"s appearance until I can see it in person.  Pictures often do not do a car justice.  Also, I think a more likeable color than that copper-pipe shade the concept car was painted would help its looks.  The toned some of the styling down and made a few subtle changes for the final version, which I haven't even seen a good picture of yet.||||reg||1
